      "en": "Seeing Peter and John about to go into the temple, he asked to receive gifts for the needy.",
      "ko": "그가 베드로와 요한이 성전에 들어 가려함을 보고 구걸하거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "97341e8fcf7c1459c0070d39942a5b4c6017190e4df2ca53fbc39af31013ce0a",
      "translation_text_hash": "59721bd77d59a308eaa4d40b17dc4005fc5522b2f5eb0b7e86ddd4641b071049",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
