      "en": "Peter, fastening his eyes on him, with John, said, “Look at us.”",
      "ko": "베드로가 요한으로 더불어 주목하여 가로되 우리를 보라 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "aaa1587d48bce5691953fa4432744d7d403b996de68f46764713274278fa43d2",
      "translation_text_hash": "338d98945c20850d528dd23e566e54b3e9ffeb44beb673700d72ffb54ab5679b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
