      "en": "All the people saw him walking and praising God.",
      "ko": "모든 백성이 그 걷는 것과 및 하나님을 찬미함을 보고",
      "source_text_hash": "1f52341309b21342db83a1fd65c4cc37bf64496cfeb2b8a190104a78492867aa",
      "translation_text_hash": "d1508f05b26debd7976db3b133912f82fe381dfaca7017d5011bb7a85fba3dcd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
