        "verse": 10
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "They recognized him, that it was he who used to sit begging for gifts for the needy at the Beautiful Gate of the temple. They were filled with wonder and amazement at what had happened to him.",
      "ko": "그 본래 성전 미문에 앉아 구걸하던 사람인줄 알고 그의 당한 일을 인하여 심히 기이히 여기며 놀라니라",
      "source_text_hash": "4f069f46fcbc1f7759ad34684cafa8a4cda87a03bbd6c1613e23cf37b22654b6",
      "translation_text_hash": "53dab3f4e895f0cebede8424e14816cb17a60de865e24bef030b2b6917f45fa0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 본래 성전 미문에 앉아 구걸하던 사람인줄 알고 그의 당한 일을 인하여 심히 기이히 여기며 놀라니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "53dab3f4e895f0cebede8424e14816cb17a60de865e24bef030b2b6917f45fa0"
      ]
